                                <span class="unit">명</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="form-label">유지율</label>
                            <div class="form-row">
                                <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm auto-calc" id="retentionRate" min="0" max="100" readonly tabindex="-1">
                                <span class="unit">%</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-hint">(총수강생 − 퇴원) ÷ 총수강생 자동 계산</div>
